77	1350	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>If your domain is poorly secured, attackers can send emails appearing to be from your company, damaging your brand and tricking your customers.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar’s DMARC Governance service moves your organization to a "Reject" policy safely. We analyze your legitimate third-party senders (like Mailchimp or Salesforce), authorize them correctly, and block all unauthorized spoofing attempts. This not only secures your brand but also ensures your legitimate marketing and business emails don't end up in the recipient's junk folder.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Our service covers the full journey from initial audit to strict enforcement:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Audit: comprehensive audit of current SPF and DKIM records.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Deployment: DMARC record deployment, managing the transition from monitoring (p=none) to enforcement (p=reject).&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Alignment: Verification and alignment of third-party senders (Salesforce, HubSpot, etc.).&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Monitoring: Continuous monitoring of spoofing attempts and forensic analysis.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Reporting: Weekly "Threat Intelligence" reports on domain abuse.</span></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	<p style="margin: 0px"><span>Neozaar utilizes a "Safe-Block" methodology to secure your email channels without disrupting business:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span><br></span></p><p style="margin: 0px"><span>Step 1: Audit Mode: We monitor in "audit mode" first to gain full visibility without blocking