1361	401	Privileged Access Management PAM	Specialized protection, continuous monitoring, and strict access controls for high-value admin accounts to prevent credential theft, privilege escalation, and lateral movement.	Privileged accounts are the "keys to the kingdom" and the top target for cybercriminals. If an administrative account is compromised, the attacker can bypass almost all other security controls. Neozaar’s PAM solution places extra layers of security around these critical identities. We eliminate "standing privileges" by implementing Just-in-Time (JIT) access, where users are granted elevated permissions only when needed and for a limited time. Every privileged session is recorded and monitored, providing complete accountability and a robust defense against both external hackers and malicious insiders.	["Credential Vaulting","Just-in-Time (JIT) Access","Session Recording & Audit","Automated Password Rotation","Least Privilege Enforcement"]	<p style="margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Protecting Domain Admins and Cloud Infrastructure roots.&nbsp;</span></li><li>Securing third-party vendor access to internal systems.&nbsp;</li><li>Meeting cyber insurance requirements for privileged access.&nbsp;</li></ul><p></p><div><br></div><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	{"SecOps Lead","IAM Lead",CISO,"SOC Lead","Compliance Officers"}	{"Identity & Access Security"}	{AWS,Azure,GCP}	{Global}	{"Request a Demo"}	<p style=" margin: 0px"></p><ul><li><span>Network access to target servers (SSH/RDP).&nbsp;</span></li><li>List of privileged users and service accounts.&nbsp;</li><li><span>Service account with permission to manage AD passwords.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><p></p><p style=" margin: 0px"><br></p><p style=" margin: 0px"></p>	One Time	\N	\N	\N	NEO-2026-1099		https://neoblob.blob.core.windows.net/neoblobcontainer/1784896313940_4786_Neozaar_Privileged_Access_Management_(PAM).jpg	{https://neozaarassets.blob.core.windows.net/assets/assets/1774587801236_2934_Privileged_Access_Manageme